gaVR(){return"Look at the same week four ways: Weekly grid, a Daily timeline, a Monthly calendar, and My Schedule for your own shifts."},
ganh(){return"Navigate & Filter"},
gang(){return"Use Today and the arrows to move between weeks, then narrow the team by department, location, or reporting scope (direct, indirect, or both)."},
