gaVP(){return"In Colleagues view you draft your own row. 'Copy last week' fills your empty days from last week, and the amber hint reminds you that your manager publishes your final schedule."},
ganv(){return"Draft Your Own Shifts"},
ganu(){return"Tap an empty day on your row to propose a shift, or tap your own draft to edit it. Days your manager has reserved show a lock and can't be edited. Your drafts stay pending until your manager publishes them."},
ga66(){return"Request a Swap"},
ga65(){return"Tap a colleague's shift to request a swap with them. You can only swap future shifts, and not when either of you is on leave or already has an open request for that day."},
